OL,3,GNEWSASteelworkers out of hospital after
OL,4,Agas leak report
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish Steel said: "Six colleagues
OL,7,Freceived treatment from our on-site
OL,8,Fteams and emergency services.
OL,9,FSubsequently, five of these colleagues
OL,10,Fwere taken to hospital for further
OL,11,Fsupport and monitoring. All five have
OL,12,Fbeen subsequently discharged from
OL,13,Fmedical care relating to the event."
OL,15,FThe company said an investigation was
OL,16,Funder way into what it described as a
OL,17,F"localised incident" and operations had
OL,18,Freturned to normal.
